## Reviewer points not applied

- Deleting U+200B (and the 005 `**​**` lines) and turning Q16–Q20 into `##` headings. Those characters and heading levels match the Korean source. Removing or promoting them fails the checker. They are not stray Italian typos.
- Renumbering section 7 to 6 and 8 to 7 in 018. The reviewer notes that the English source skips 6 as well. Changing the numbers would diverge from that outline, and the standing rules say not to change numbers.
- The suggested 004 link text drops “10”. That fails `numbers`. The digit is kept in a clause that says article 10 of the business-tax act is not this provision. The reviewer’s statute name (各類所得扣繳率標準) is what the Italian label already said; the URL `pcode=G0340028` is the business-tax act, which is what the English and Korean labels name. The URL was not changed. The label was not rewritten into the business-tax act, because the review asked to keep the withholding-standards name and only to stop calling the linked page article 10.
- Replacing “fino a una volta l’importo” with a wording that contains no “1”. “una volta” is parsed as 1; the cap is now “in misura non superiore al danno effettivo (1 volta)”.
